<title>USA: Wyoming Devel Auth repriced, ylds 6.35 pct in 2029.</title>
<headline>Wyoming Devel Auth repriced, ylds 6.35 pct in 2029.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
